@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ito-il27-nouns`
IMPORT `ito-il27-tax-years`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Income Tax Ordinance s 46A — "תקרה כוללת להטבות מס לתרומות ולמו״פ", the overall ceiling on the tax benefits for donations and for
-- research and development. Row IL-27. Source lines 1753-1754.
--
-- "Notwithstanding any law", the total sums for which a credit is given in a tax year for donations under s 46, and a deduction for
-- participating in financing research and development carried out by another under s 20A and under the Law of 5744-1983 on investment in
-- securities for scientific research, shall not exceed 50% of the assessee's taxable income in that year, taken before the deduction for
-- participating in research and development.
--
-- FORK F8: when the total passes the ceiling, the section does not say whether the credit's sums or the deduction are cut. RULED by Meng on
-- 2026-10-08 (SHRUG): one named switch, default declined where the total passes the ceiling (the answer being given where it does not),
-- both cuts kept by name and tested. s 20A and the 1983 Law are not in the source bundle: the deduction under them is an input.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Section 46A — the overall ceiling`

-- src:1754 | על אף האמור בכל דין, הסכום הכולל שבשלו יותר בשנת מס פלונית זיכוי בשל תרומות על פי סעיף 46 וניכוי בשל השתתפות במימון מחקר ופיתוח שמבצע אדם אחר על פי סעיף 20א ועל פי חוק מס הכנסה (הטבות להשקעה בניירות ערך שתמורתם נועדה למחקר מדעי), התשמ״ד–1983 לא יעלה על 50% מהכנסתו החייבת של נישום באותה שנה; לענין זה, ”הכנסה חייבת“ – לפני הניכוי בשל השתתפות במחקר ופיתוח.

@ref ITO s 46A, line 1754; fork F8
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`section 46A does not say whether the credit or the deduction is cut first, and here the total passes the ceiling` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 46A does not say whether the credit or the deduction is cut first, and here the total passes the ceiling"

@ref ITO s 46A, line 1754; fork F8; Meng's ruling of 2026-10-08 (SHRUG)
GIVETH A `A reading of the cut under section 46A`
`section 46A — the reading row IL-27 takes of the cut` MEANS
    `declined where the total passes the ceiling`

@ref ITO s 46A, line 1754
GIVEN x IS A `Donations and research and development in a tax year, for section 46A`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 46A — the ceiling on the total, for` x MEANS
    50% TIMES x's `taxable income before the deduction for participating in research and development`

@ref ITO s 46A, line 1754
GIVEN x IS A `Donations and research and development in a tax year, for section 46A`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 46A — the total passes the ceiling, for` x MEANS
    x's `sums on which a credit for donations under section 46 is given` PLUS x's `sums deducted for participating in research and development under section 20A and the Law of 5744-1983`
    GREATER THAN `s 46A — the ceiling on the total, for` x

-- The sums on which the credit under s 46 is given, after the ceiling.
@ref ITO s 46A, line 1754; fork F8
GIVEN r IS A `A reading of the cut under section 46A`
      x IS A `Donations and research and development in a tax year, for section 46A`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the sums on which the credit under section 46 is given after section 46A, reading the cut as` r `, for` x MEANS
    `for tax year` (x's `tax year`) `, row IL-27 answers`
        (IF   NOT `s 46A — the total passes the ceiling, for` x
         THEN `credit`
         ELSE CONSIDER r
              WHEN `the credit is cut first`  THEN max 0 (`ceiling` MINUS `deduction`)
              WHEN `the deduction is cut first` THEN min `credit` `ceiling`
              WHEN `declined where the total passes the ceiling` THEN IF (max 0 (`ceiling` MINUS `deduction`)) EQUALS (min `credit` `ceiling`) THEN (max 0 (`ceiling` MINUS `deduction`)) ELSE `section 46A does not say whether the credit or the deduction is cut first, and here the total passes the ceiling`)
    WHERE
        `credit`    MEANS x's `sums on which a credit for donations under section 46 is given`
        `deduction` MEANS x's `sums deducted for participating in research and development under section 20A and the Law of 5744-1983`
        `ceiling`   MEANS `s 46A — the ceiling on the total, for` x

-- The sums deducted for research and development, after the ceiling.
@ref ITO s 46A, line 1754; fork F8
GIVEN r IS A `A reading of the cut under section 46A`
      x IS A `Donations and research and development in a tax year, for section 46A`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the sums deducted for research and development after section 46A, reading the cut as` r `, for` x MEANS
    `for tax year` (x's `tax year`) `, row IL-27 answers`
        (IF   NOT `s 46A — the total passes the ceiling, for` x
         THEN `deduction`
         ELSE CONSIDER r
              WHEN `the credit is cut first`  THEN min `deduction` `ceiling`
              WHEN `the deduction is cut first` THEN max 0 (`ceiling` MINUS min `credit` `ceiling`)
              WHEN `declined where the total passes the ceiling` THEN IF (min `deduction` `ceiling`) EQUALS (max 0 (`ceiling` MINUS min `credit` `ceiling`)) THEN (min `deduction` `ceiling`) ELSE `section 46A does not say whether the credit or the deduction is cut first, and here the total passes the ceiling`)
    WHERE
        `credit`    MEANS x's `sums on which a credit for donations under section 46 is given`
        `deduction` MEANS x's `sums deducted for participating in research and development under section 20A and the Law of 5744-1983`
        `ceiling`   MEANS `s 46A — the ceiling on the total, for` x

@export The sums on which the credit for donations under Income Tax Ordinance s 46 is given after the overall ceiling of s 46A (50% of taxable income before the research and development deduction, shared with the s 20A deduction), for a tax year from 2024; declines where the total passes the ceiling, since the section does not say which is cut
@ref ITO s 46A, line 1754
GIVEN x IS A `Donations and research and development in a tax year, for section 46A`
          @desc the tax year, the taxable income before the research and development deduction, the sums on which the s 46 credit is given, and the sums deducted for research and development
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the sums on which the credit under section 46 is given after section 46A for` x MEANS
    `the sums on which the credit under section 46 is given after section 46A, reading the cut as` `section 46A — the reading row IL-27 takes of the cut` `, for` x

@export The sums deducted for participating in research and development after the overall ceiling of Income Tax Ordinance s 46A, for a tax year from 2024; declines where the total passes the ceiling, since the section does not say which is cut
@ref ITO s 46A, line 1754
GIVEN x IS A `Donations and research and development in a tax year, for section 46A`
          @desc the tax year, the taxable income before the research and development deduction, the sums on which the s 46 credit is given, and the sums deducted for research and development
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the sums deducted for research and development after section 46A for` x MEANS
    `the sums deducted for research and development after section 46A, reading the cut as` `section 46A — the reading row IL-27 takes of the cut` `, for` x
